#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:1
msgid "Triton-Ascend max_autotune 使用指南"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend max_autotune Usage Guide"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:3
msgid "文档定位"
msgstr "Document Positioning"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:5
msgid "本文面向已经熟悉 Triton-Ascend 自动调优机制的用户，介绍 `max_autotune` 装饰器的高级用法："
msgstr ""
"This document is intended for users who are already familiar with Triton-"
"Ascend's automatic tuning mechanism, and introduces advanced usage of the "
"`max_autotune` decorator:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:7
msgid "`max_autotune` 与标准 `@triton.autotune` 的区别与联系；"
msgstr ""
"`max_autotune` and the standard `@triton.autotune`: differences and "
"connections."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:8
msgid "如何利用笛卡尔积展开机制批量生成候选配置；"
msgstr ""
"How to use the Cartesian product expansion mechanism to batch generate "
"candidate configurations."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:9
msgid "不同 `kernel_type` 支持的调优参数及其适用场景；"
msgstr ""
"Tuning parameters supported by different `kernel_type` and their applicable "
"scenarios."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:10
msgid "何时选择 `max_autotune` 而非手写配置列表。"
msgstr "When to choose `max_autotune` over a hand-written configuration list."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:12
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:14
msgid ""
"`max_autotune` 是 `@triton.autotune` "
"的扩展版装饰器，它允许在自动调优前将每个基础配置与额外的调优参数进行笛卡尔积展开，从而大幅减少用户需要手工枚举的配置数量。"
msgstr ""
"`max_autotune` is an extended version of the `@triton.autotune` decorator, "
"which allows each base configuration to be expanded via a Cartesian product "
"with additional tuning parameters before autotuning, thereby significantly "
"reducing the number of configurations users need to manually enumerate."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:16
msgid "1. 基本用法"
msgstr "1\\. Basic Usage"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:18
msgid ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'BLOCK_N': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 64, 'BLOCK_N': 256}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"mix\",\n"
"    # 额外的调优参数，每个值必须是列表\n"
"    enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=[True, False],\n"
"    tile_mix_vector_loop=[2, 4],\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(\n"
"    a_ptr,\n"
"    b_ptr,\n"
"    M,\n"
"    N,\n"
"    BLOCK_M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    **META\n"
"):\n"
"    ..."
msgstr ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'BLOCK_N': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 64, 'BLOCK_N': 256}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"mix\",\n"
"    # Additional tuning parameters, each value must be a list\n"
"    enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=[True, False],\n"
"    tile_mix_vector_loop=[2, 4],\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(\n"
"    a_ptr,\n"
"    b_ptr,\n"
"    M,\n"
"    N,\n"
"    BLOCK_M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    **META\n"
"):\n"
"    ..."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:48
msgid "上述配置展开后的等效配置数量为："
msgstr ""
"The equivalent configuration count after expanding the above configurations "
"is:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:50 ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:235
msgid "基础配置：2 个"
msgstr "Basic configuration: 2"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:51
msgid ""
"用户提供的调优参数：`enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance`（2 种）、`tile_mix_vector_loop`（2 种）"
msgstr ""
"User-provided tuning parameters: `enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance` (2 types), "
"`tile_mix_vector_loop` (2 types)"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:52
msgid ""
"使用默认值的参数：`set_workspace_multibuffer`（2 种）、`tile_mix_cube_loop`（2 种）、其他参数各 1 "
"种"
msgstr ""
"Parameters using default values: `set_workspace_multibuffer` (2 types), "
"`tile_mix_cube_loop` (2 types), and 1 type for each of the other parameters."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:54
msgid "总配置数量：`2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 32` 个配置。"
msgstr ""
"Total number of configurations: `2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 32` configurations."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:56
msgid ""
"注：`kernel_type=\"mix\"` 支持的参数较多，未显式提供的参数会使用默认值参与展开。如果希望某个参数不参与展开，可在基础 "
"`Config` 的 `kwargs` 中固定其值。"
msgstr ""
"Note: `kernel_type=\"mix\"` supports many parameters; parameters not "
"explicitly provided will use default values in the expansion. If you want a "
"parameter to not participate in the expansion, you can fix its value in the "
"`kwargs` of the base `Config`."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:58
msgid "2. `max_autotune` 与 `@triton.autotune` 的关系"
msgstr "2\\. The relationship between `max_autotune` and `@triton.autotune`"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:60
msgid ""
"`max_autotune` 本质上是先调用 `get_max_configs` 对基础配置进行展开，然后将展开后的配置列表传递给标准的 "
"`@triton.autotune`。因此："
msgstr ""
"`max_autotune` essentially first calls `get_max_configs` to expand the base "
"configuration, and then passes the expanded configuration list to the "
"standard `@triton.autotune`. Therefore:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:62
msgid ""
"所有 `@triton.autotune` 支持的参数（`key`、`prune_configs_by`、`reset_to_zero` 等）在 "
"`max_autotune` 中同样有效；"
msgstr ""
"All parameters supported by `@triton.autotune` (such as `key`, "
"`prune_configs_by`, `reset_to_zero`, etc.) are equally valid in "
"`max_autotune`."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:63
msgid "`max_autotune` 额外增加了 `kernel_type` 参数和 `**tuning_params` 调优参数空间；"
msgstr ""
"`max_autotune` additionally adds the `kernel_type` parameter and the "
"`**tuning_params` tuning parameter space."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:64
msgid "最终仍然是 `@triton.autotune` 完成 benchmark、选优和缓存。"
msgstr ""
"Ultimately, it is still `@triton.autotune` that handles benchmarking, "
"selection, and caching."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:66
msgid "3. 必须导入 Ascend backend 扩展"
msgstr "3\\. Must import the Ascend backend extension."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:68
msgid ""
"与使用 `configs=[]` 自动 Tiling 一样，`max_autotune` 需要 Ascend backend "
"扩展支持。`max_autotune` 需要从 Ascend backend 模块单独导入："
msgstr ""
"Same as automatic tiling with `configs=[]`, `max_autotune` requires support "
"from the Ascend backend extension. `max_autotune` needs to be imported "
"separately from the Ascend backend module:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:70
msgid "from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
msgstr "from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:74
msgid "Kernel 类型与支持的参数"
msgstr "Kernel types and supported parameters"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:76
msgid "`max_autotune` 通过 `kernel_type` 参数区分不同类型的算子，每种类型支持不同的调优参数集合。"
msgstr ""
"`max_autotune` distinguishes different types of operators through the "
"`kernel_type` parameter, and each type supports a different set of tuning "
"parameters."

