#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:92
msgid "Kernel 类型说明"
msgstr "Kernel Type Description"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:94
msgid "**cube**：纯 cube（矩阵乘法类）算子，支持最少的调优参数；"
msgstr ""
"**cube**: Pure cube (matrix multiplication) operator, supporting minimal "
"tuning parameters."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:95
msgid "**vector**：纯向量算子，仅支持 `num_stages` 和 `enable_ubuf_saving`；"
msgstr ""
"**vector**: Pure vector operator, supports only `num_stages` and "
"`enable_ubuf_saving`."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:96
msgid "**mix**：混合 cube+vector 算子（默认类型），支持最完整的调优参数集合。"
msgstr ""
"**mix**: Mixed cube+vector operator (default type), supports the most "
"complete set of tuning parameters."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:98
msgid "参数值优先级与展开逻辑"
msgstr "Parameter Value Priority and Expansion Logic"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:100
msgid "参数值优先级"
msgstr "Parameter value priority"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:102
msgid "调优参数的值按以下优先级确定："
msgstr ""
"The values of tuning parameters are determined according to the following "
"priority:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:104
msgid "**tuning_params 参数**（最高优先级）：通过 `**tuning_params` 传递的候选值列表；"
msgstr ""
"**tuning_params parameter** (highest priority): the list of candidate values"
" passed via `**tuning_params`;"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:105
msgid "**基础配置中的值**：如果基础 `Config` 的 `kwargs` 中已存在该参数，则固定为该值（转换为单元素列表）；"
msgstr ""
"**Values in the base configuration**: If the parameter already exists in the"
" `kwargs` of the base `Config`, it is fixed to that value (converted to a "
"single-element list)."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:106
msgid "**默认值**（最低优先级）：从内部默认值表获取。"
msgstr ""
"**Default Value** (lowest priority): Retrieved from the internal default "
"value table."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:108
msgid "展开示例"
msgstr "Expand example"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:110
msgid "假设有以下配置："
msgstr "Assuming the following configuration:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:112
msgid ""
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128}, num_stages=2)],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",\n"
"    num_stages=[1, 2],\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(...):\n"
"    ...\n"
msgstr ""
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128}, num_stages=2)],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",\n"
"    num_stages=[1, 2],\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(...):\n"
"    ...\n"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:124
msgid "展开过程："
msgstr "Expansion process:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:126
msgid "`kernel_type=\"vector\"` 支持的参数为 `num_stages` 和 `enable_ubuf_saving`；"
msgstr ""
"The parameters supported by `kernel_type=\"vector\"` are `num_stages` and "
"`enable_ubuf_saving`;"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:127
msgid "`num_stages` 在 `tuning_params` 中提供 `[1, 2]`，优先级最高；"
msgstr ""
"`num_stages` is provided as `[1, 2]` in `tuning_params`, with the highest "
"priority;"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:128
msgid "`enable_ubuf_saving` 未提供，使用默认值 `[True]`；"
msgstr "`enable_ubuf_saving` not provided, using default value `[True]`;"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:129
msgid "笛卡尔积展开后得到 2 个配置。"
msgstr "After Cartesian product expansion, 2 configurations are obtained."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:131
msgid "展开结果等效于："
msgstr "The expanded result is equivalent to:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:133
msgid ""
"configs=[\n"
"    triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'enable_ubuf_saving': True}, num_stages=1),\n"
"    triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'enable_ubuf_saving': True}, num_stages=2),\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"configs=[\n"
"    triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'enable_ubuf_saving': True}, num_stages=1),\n"
"    triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'enable_ubuf_saving': True}, num_stages=2),\n"
"]\n"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:140
msgid "在基础配置中固定参数"
msgstr "Fixed parameters in the base configuration."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:142
msgid "如果希望某个调优参数不参与展开，可以在基础配置中直接固定："
msgstr ""
"If you want a certain tuning parameter to not participate in expansion, you "
"can directly fix it in the base configuration:"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:144
msgid ""
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'enable_ubuf_saving': False}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",\n"
"    num_stages=[1, 2],\n"
"    # enable_ubuf_saving 已在基础配置中固定为 False，不会使用默认值 [True]\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(...):\n"
"    ..."
msgstr ""
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config(kwargs={'BLOCK_M': 128, 'enable_ubuf_saving': False}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=[\"M\", \"N\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",\n"
"    num_stages=[1, 2],\n"
"    # enable_ubuf_saving is already fixed to False in the base configuration; the default value [True] will not be used\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(...):\n"
"    ..."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:159
msgid "使用注意事项"
msgstr "Usage Notes"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:161
msgid "1. 不支持的参数会被忽略"
msgstr "1\\. Unsupported parameters will be ignored."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:163
msgid "如果通过 `tuning_params` 传递了当前 `kernel_type` 不支持的参数，会产生警告并忽略该参数："
msgstr ""
"If parameters not supported by the current `kernel_type` are passed via "
"`tuning_params`, a warning will be generated and the parameter will be "
"ignored."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:165
msgid ""
"# 警告：tile_mix_vector_loop 不支持 kernel_type=\"vector\"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[...],\n"
"    key=[\"M\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",\n"
"    tile_mix_vector_loop=[2, 4],  # 将被忽略并产生警告\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(...):\n"
"    ..."
msgstr ""
"# Warning: tile_mix_vector_loop does not support kernel_type=\"vector\"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[...],\n"
"    key=[\"M\"],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",\n"
"    tile_mix_vector_loop=[2, 4],  # Will be ignored and produce a warning\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel(...):\n"
"    ..."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:178
msgid "2. 参数值必须是列表"
msgstr "2\\. Parameter values must be lists."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:180
msgid "`tuning_params` 中的每个值必须是列表或元组，且不能为空："
msgstr ""
"Each value in `tuning_params` must be a list or tuple, and cannot be empty."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:182
msgid ""
"# 正确写法\n"
"enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=[True, False]\n"
"\n"
"# 错误写法：不是列表\n"
"enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=True  # 将导致验证错误"
msgstr ""
"# Correct usage\n"
"enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=[True, False]\n"
"\n"
"# Incorrect usage: not a list\n"
"enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance=True  # Will cause a validation error"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:190
msgid "3. 配置数量增长"
msgstr "3\\. Increase in configuration quantity"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:192
msgid "展开后的配置数量等于： 基础配置数量 × Π(每个 tuning_param 的列表长度)"
msgstr ""
"The number of expanded configurations equals: base configuration count × "
"Π(length of each tuning_param's list)"

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:195
