msgid "希望通过笛卡尔积方式批量生成候选配置。"
msgstr ""
"I hope to batch generate candidate configurations using the Cartesian "
"product method."

#: ../../zh/max_autotune_guide.md:289
msgid "`max_autotune` 的核心价值在于：用少量基础配置 + 调优参数空间描述，自动展开出完整的候选配置集合，兼顾了灵活性与便利性。"
msgstr ""
"The core value of `max_autotune` lies in: using a small amount of basic "
"configuration plus a description of the tuning parameter space, it "
"automatically expands into a complete set of candidate configurations, "
"balancing flexibility and convenience."
